  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "UJMiksSwuMJvwXrJLULMykSw6qZ6VqaxOkN4qd5cW1Q4HhsLxvUR5xVOIv1WB3br5LoP20lPa8xiYLSMbt8JqHACXdSdw7fNkhRTIHnadxWW5jfDg7BELUB0FcFfPiv0",
      "help_en": "The token to revoke, which can be an access token or a refresh token.  \nIf an access_token is provided, only the access token is revoked, and the refresh token can still be used to obtain a new access token.  \nIf a refresh_token is provided, both the access token and the corresponding refresh token are revoked.  ",
      "help_zh": "要撤销的令牌，可以是访问令牌或刷新令牌。\n如果传递的是access_token，则仅会撤销access_token，refresh_token依然可以刷新获取新的访问令牌。\n如果传递的是refresh_token，则会同时撤销access_token和对应的refresh_token",
      "location": "formData",
      "name": "token",
      "options": [
        "--token"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Token",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "refresh_token",
      "help_en": "A hint about the type of token being revoked, which can be access_token or refresh_token, to help the authorization server identify the token type.  ",
      "help_zh": "令牌类型的提示，可以是access_token或refresh_token，用于帮助授权服务器理解要撤销的是哪种类型的令牌",
      "location": "formData",
      "name": "token_type_hint",
